| User confirms submission | Case ID generated | `beacon` row inserted (final case record) |
| Background task runs | AI summarizes + scores | `beacon` row updated with `ai_summary`, [credibility_score](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/models/beacon.py#80-86) |
| Reporter tracks case | Case data fetched | `beacon` + `beacon_update` queried |
| Admin views case | All data displayed | `beacon` + `beacon_message` queried |
| Admin publishes update | LLM rewrites for public display | `beacon_update` row inserted |
| Two-way message sent | Message stored | `beacon_message` row inserted |

