| `beacon` | **Final case records** | [case_id](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/models/beacon.py#70-79), `secret_key_hash`, [credibility_score](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/models/beacon.py#80-86), `ai_summary` |
| `beacon_update` | Admin status updates | [case_id](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/models/beacon.py#70-79), `public_update`, `created_at` |
| `beacon_message` | Two-way communication | [case_id](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/models/beacon.py#70-79), `sender_role`, `content`, `attachments` |

---

#### How Anonymity Is Preserved

1. **No user ID exists** — The [reports](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/api/v1/admin/reports.py#69-123) and `beacon` tables have no `user_id` field
2. **Session token is random** — Generated as `tk_{random_hex}`
3. **Token is hashed** — Only the hash is stored: `access_token_hash = sha256(token)`
4. **Secret key is hashed** — Stored as `secret_key_hash = pbkdf2(secret_key)`
5. **PII is redacted** — Frontend sanitizes emails/phones before display

---

#### How Chat Messages Are Processed

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as /api/v1/public/reports/message
    participant RE as ReportEngine
    participant LLM as LLMAgent (Groq)
    participant DB as Supabase

    FE->>API: POST message (report_id, access_token, content)
    API->>RE: process_message()
    RE->>DB: Store user message
    RE->>DB: Fetch conversation history
    RE->>DB: Fetch evidence metadata
    opt New evidence uploaded
        RE->>LLM: analyze_image_fast() / analyze_audio_fast()
    end
    RE->>LLM: chat(conversation_history, state)
    LLM-->>RE: Response + extracted_data (JSON)
    RE->>DB: Store system response
    alt Report complete (placeholders detected)
        RE->>DB: Generate Case ID + Secret Key
        RE->>DB: INSERT into beacon table
        RE-->>API: Return case_id + secret_key
    end
    API-->>FE: Response with next_step
```

---

#### How Evidence Uploads Work

1. **Frontend** uploads file via `multipart/form-data`
2. **Backend** receives file, uploads to Supabase Storage
3. **File path** stored as `supastorage://evidence/{year}/{month}/{uuid}_{filename}`
4. **Metadata** inserted into [evidence](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/services/ai_service.py#172-197) table
5. **On finalization**, evidence metadata synced to `beacon.evidence_files` (JSON)

---

#### How Background Scoring Works

After a case is finalized, a background task is triggered:

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Case Finalized] --> B[Background Task Triggered]
    B --> C[Fetch Chat History]
    B --> D[Fetch Evidence Files]
    D --> E[Run EvidenceProcessor]
    E --> E1[OCR on Images]
    E --> E2[Transcription on Audio]
    E --> E3[Visual Analysis]
    C --> F[Generate AI Summary]
    E --> G[Calculate Credibility Score]
    F --> H[Update Beacon Row]
    G --> H
```

**ScoringService** ([scoring_service.py](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/services/scoring_service.py)) orchestrates this with:
- **Global lock** to prevent parallel Groq API spikes
- **Aggressive retry** with exponential backoff (5s, 15s, 30s, 60s, 120s, 180s)
- **Graceful error handling** — Cases marked `analysis_status = "failed"` with error logged

---

## AI Usage and Limitations

### Where AI IS Used

| Feature | AI Model | Purpose |
|---------|----------|---------|
| Chat Guidance | Llama 3.3 70B (Groq) | Ask structured questions, extract key facts |
| Case Summary | Llama 3.3 70B (Groq) | Generate professional intelligence summary |
| Credibility Scoring | Llama 3.3 70B (Groq) | Analyze narrative + evidence quality |
| Image Analysis | Llama 4 Scout (Groq) + Gemini 2.0 | Describe visual context |
| OCR Text Analysis | Llama 3.3 70B (Groq) | Analyze extracted text |
| Audio Transcription | Whisper Large v3 (Groq) | Convert speech to text |
| Update Rewriting | Llama 3.3 70B (Groq) | Reframe admin updates for public display |

### Where AI is NOT Used

> [!CAUTION]
> AI does NOT:
> - Determine truth or falsity of a report
> - Recommend legal action or escalation
> - Match reporters to profiles
> - Make any automated enforcement decisions

### Credibility Scoring Explained

The credibility score is **0-100** based on three components:

| Component | Weight | What It Measures |
|-----------|--------|------------------|
| Narrative Consistency | 0-40 | Specificity of WHO/WHAT/WHERE/WHEN |
| Evidence Strength | 0-40 | Quality and relevance of uploaded files |
| Behavioral Reliability | 0-20 | Cooperativeness during conversation |

**Scoring Rules (from [ai_service.py](file:///c:/Users/priya/OneDrive/Desktop/Corrupt%20sredibilty%20updated/coorupt/backend/app/services/ai_service.py)):**
- **No evidence = Evidence score 0**
- **Unrelated evidence = Evidence score 0**
- **Vague story = Narrative score max 15**
- **Score 60+ requires strong details + relevant evidence**

### Fallback Behavior

| Scenario | Behavior |
|----------|----------|
| Groq API rate limit (429) | Retry with exponential backoff; return friendly message |
| Groq API timeout | Fall back to mock response asking user to try again |
| Vision model fails | Fall back to Gemini 2.0 |
| All retries exhausted | Mark `analysis_status = "failed"` with error logged |

