- **Async-first FastAPI backend** — handles thousands of concurrent sessions
- **Supabase PostgreSQL** — enterprise-grade cloud database
- **Groq Cloud AI** — Llama 3.3 70B for reasoning, Whisper for transcription
- **Multi-modal evidence analysis** — OCR, visual context, audio transcription
- **Explainable AI scoring** — full breakdown with rationale
- **Two-way anonymous communication** — unique in the space
- **JWT authentication for admins** — industry-standard security

